      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nSituated on Bredin Street in the highly sought-after area of North Drogheda, this property enjoys a convenient and well-established residential setting within easy reach of Drogheda town centre. Residents benefit from an excellent range of amenities, including a variety of supermarkets, local shops, cafés, restaurants, and traditional pubs catering to every taste and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFor those with an active lifestyle, the area offers an abundance of sporting and recreational facilities, including golf courses, GAA clubs, football clubs, rugby clubs, athletics facilities, and leisure centres. Families are particularly well served by a selection of reputable primary and secondary schools, together with numerous community and recreational activities for children of all ages.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is thoughtfully laid out to provide comfortable living throughout. The property comprises an entrance porch, hallway, spacious living room with solid fuel stove, kitchen/dining area, two bedrooms, a main shower room, and an en-suite shower room off the principal bedroom.\r\nThe bright and functional kitchen/dining area features a selection of fitted units with generous countertop space, providing an ideal environment for cooking and dining. The room comfortably accommodates a dining table and chairs, making it a welcoming space for both everyday family life and entertaining guests. Its practical layout enhances the overall flow of the accommodation and complements the spacious living room perfectly.\r\n\r\nThis property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a home in a mature and convenient location close to all essential amenities.\r\n\r\nBER Rating - C\r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended – Please contact Declan."
      },
